OL,3,GNEWSAFamily tribute to 'caring' cyclist
OL,4,Awho died in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who died after being hit by a car
OL,7,Fin Nottinghamshire was "positive, kind
OL,8,Fand caring", his family has said.
OL,10,FTrizain Meyler was riding a bicycle
OL,11,Falong Blyth Road, Harworth, on 19
OL,12,FAugust when he was struck at about
OL,13,F02:00 BST.
OL,15,FPolice said that, despite the best
OL,16,Fefforts of emergency services, the
OL,17,F20-year-old died at the scene.
OL,19,F"His laugh was contagious, his loyalty
OL,20,Fwas solid and he had a strength about
OL,21,Fhim that meant he didn't let things get
OL,22,Fhim down," his family said.
